  "term": "inspection time",
  "definition": "Inspection time is a measure of how quickly a person can recognize visual objects in a visuo-cognitive task. In this source, it is described as an index of object-recognition speed linked to the ventral visual pathway and studied in relation to fluid intelligence.",
